WEBVTT

9.1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.400
A few last things.

9.2
00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:11.342
To keep the portal one tap away, choose Install app. On an iPhone, follow the steps to add it to your home screen.

9.3
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.675
To change your password, go to Settings.

9.4
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:26.358
Working on lots of jobs at once? Switch to By item, at the bottom of the screen, to see each plant across every open request, and answer each one right there.

9.5
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.875
By status groups everything by your answer, so you can see what's on order or arriving soon.

9.6
00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:37.308
Light or dark mode, and Log out, live in the menu.

9.7
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:44.600
Check the portal each day, or keep the app on your phone, so new requests never wait.

9.8
00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:49.517
Thanks for partnering with Local Plant Supply. We're glad to have you.
